# UI — HeroUI only

All interactive and layout UI comes from `@heroui/react` (+ `@heroui/styles` / Tailwind as already set up).

## Rules

- Prefer HeroUI primitives: Button, Input, Select, Modal, Table, Card, Tabs, Dropdown, Checkbox, Switch, Textarea, Pagination, Spinner, Chip, etc.
- Do **not** invent custom buttons, inputs, modals, or tables when HeroUI already provides them
- Custom wrappers are allowed only to compose HeroUI + project props (i18n, form binding)
- Styling: Tailwind utilities + HeroUI theming; avoid one-off CSS for components HeroUI covers
- Forms: `react-hook-form` + HeroUI form controls
- Icons/layout helpers may be project-local; interactive controls stay HeroUI

## ❌ BAD

```tsx
<button className="px-4 py-2 rounded bg-blue-500">Save</button>
```

## ✅ GOOD

```tsx
import { Button } from '@heroui/react'

<Button type="submit">{t('common.save')}</Button>
```
